Name = \"Unknown User\"\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Validation: Check for invalid/empty payor UID\n                if (memberUid == null || memberUid.isEmpty()) {\n                    Toast.makeText(this, \"Invalid payor found in group\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                    progressBar!!.visibility = View.GONE\n                    return\n                }\n\n                payorsList!!.add(memberUid) // Store UID\n                payorsDisplayNames!!.add(if (memberDisplayName != null) memberDisplayName else \"Unknown User\")\n\n                amountsPaidList!!.add(individualAmount)\n                totalAmountPaid += individualAmount\n            }\n\n            totalIndividualPayment = individualAmount\n        }\n\n        // Final validation: Total of amountsPaidList must equal payment amount\n        var finalSum = 0.0\n        for (amount in amountsPaidList!!) {\n            finalSum += amount!!\n        }\n\n        if (abs(finalSum - paymentAmount!!) > 0.01) {\n            Toast.makeText(\n                this,\n                \"Total amount paid (\" + CurrencyUtils.formatAmountWithCurrency(finalSum) + \") does not match payment amount (\" + CurrencyUtils.formatAmountWithCurrency(\n                    paymentAmount!!\n                ) + \")\",\n                Toast.LENGTH_LONG\n            ).show()\n            progressBar!!.visibility = View.GONE\n            return\n        }\n\n        // Final validation: Ensure payorsList is not empty\n        if (payorsList!!.isEmpty()) {\n            Toast.makeText(\n                this,\n                \"No payors found. Please select a group with members.\",\n                Toast.LENGTH_SHORT\n            ).show()\n            progressBar!!.visibility = View.GONE\n            return\n        }\n\n        // Log all payors and amounts for verification\n        Log.d(\"AddTransaction\", \"=== Transaction Summary ===\")\n        Log.d(\"AddTransaction\", \"Transaction Type: \" + transactionType)\n        Log.d(\"AddTransaction\", \"Payment Amount: ₱\" + paymentAmount)\n        Log.d(\"AddTransaction\", \"Number of Payors: \" + payorsList!!.size)\n        for (i in payorsList!!.indices) {\n            Log.d(\n                \"AddTransaction\", \"Payor \" + (i + 1) + \": \" + payorsDisplayNames!![i] +\n                        \" (UID: \" + payorsList!![i] + \") - Amount: ₱\" + amountsPaidList!![i]\n            )\n        }\n        Log.d(\"AddTransaction\", \"Total of Individual Amounts: ₱\" + finalSum)\n        Log.d(\"AddTransaction\", \"===========================\")\n\n        val currentUserID = FirebaseAuth.getInstance().currentUser!!.uid\n        val usersRef = DeclareDatabase.databaseReference.child(currentUserID)\n\n        usersRef.child(\"username\").addListenerForSingleValueEvent(object : ValueEventListener {\n            override fun onDataChange(dataSnapshot: DataSnapshot) {\n                if (dataSnapshot.exists()) {\n                    posterDisplayName = dataSnapshot.getValue(String::class.java)\n                    usernamePost = currentUserID // Store UID instead of username\n                    saveTransaction()\n                } else {\n                    progressBar!!.visibility = View.GONE\n                    Toast.makeText(\n                        this@AddTransactionActivity,\n                        \"Username not found.\",\n                        Toast.LENGTH_SHORT\n                    ).show()\n                }\n            }\n\n            override fun onCancelled(databaseError: DatabaseError) {\n                progressBar!!.visibility = View.GONE\n                Log.e(\n                    \"FirebaseDatabase\",\n                    \"Database read error occurred: \" + databaseError.message\n                )\n            }\n        })\n    }\n\n    private fun saveTransaction() {\n        val calendar = Calendar.getInstance()\n        val dateFormat = SimpleDateFormat(\"MMMM-yyyy\", Locale.getDefault())\n        val dayFormat = SimpleDateFormat(\"dd\", Locale.getDefault())\n        val timeFormat = SimpleDateFormat(\"HH:mm:ss\", Locale.getDefault())\n\n        val currentMonthYear = dateFormat.format(calendar.time)\n        val currentDay = dayFormat.format(calendar.time)\n        val currentTime = timeFormat.format(calendar.time)\n\n        val timestampRef = DeclareDatabase.dBRefTransaction\n            .child(currentMonthYear)\n            .child(currentDay)\n            .child(currentTime)\n\n        val transaction: Transaction?\n        val currentGroup = selectedGroup\n        if (currentGroup != null) {\n            // Use new constructor with display names - payorsList contains UIDs, usernamePost contains UID\n            transaction = Transaction(\n                transactionType, paymentAmount!!, multilineStr,\n                payorsList, amountsPaidList, usernamePost, totalIndividualPayment,\n                currentGroup.groupId, currentGroup.groupName,\n                payorsDisplayNames, posterDisplayName\n            )\n        } else {\n            // Use new constructor with display names - payorsList contains UIDs, usernamePost contains UID\n            transaction = Transaction(\n                transactionType, paymentAmount!!, multilineStr,\n                payorsList, amountsPaidList, usernamePost, totalIndividualPayment,\n                null, null, payorsDisplayNames, posterDisplayName\n            )\n        }\n\n        timestampRef.setValue(transaction)\n            .addOnSuccessListener { aVoid: Void? ->\n                progressBar!!.visibility = View.GONE\n                Toast.makeText(\n                    this@AddTransactionActivity,\n                    \"Transaction added successfully\",\n                    Toast.LENGTH_SHORT\n                ).show()\n                val intent = Intent(this@AddTransactionActivity, MainActivity::class.java)\n                startActivity(intent)\n                finish()\n            }\n            .addOnFailureListener { e: Exception? ->\n                progressBar!!.visibility = View.GONE\n                Toast.makeText(\n                    this@AddTransactionActivity,\n                    \"Failed to add transaction\",\n                    Toast.LENGTH_SHORT\n                ).show()\n            }\n    }\n\n\n    private fun setupIndividualPaymentCalculator() {\n        paymentAmountEditText!!.addTextChangedListener(object : TextWatcher {\n            override fun beforeTextChanged(s: CharSequence?, start: Int, count: Int, after: Int) {\n            }\n\n            override fun onTextChanged(s: CharSequence?, start: Int, before: Int, count: Int) {\n            }\n\n            override fun afterTextChanged(s: Editable?) {\n                calculateAndDisplayIndividualPayment()\n            }\n        })\n    }\n\n    private fun calculateAndDisplayIndividualPayment() {\n        val amountStr = paymentAmountEditText!!.text.toString()\n        if (!TextUtils.isEmpty(amountStr)) {\n            try {\n                val amount = amountStr.toDouble()\n                val numberOfUsers: Int\n\n                // If a group is selected, use the group's member count\n                val currentGroup = selectedGroup\n                if (currentGroup != null && currentGroup.members != null && !currentGroup.members!!\n                        .isEmpty()\n                ) {\n                    numberOfUsers = currentGroup.members!!.size\n                } else if (usernames != null && usernames!!.size > 1) {\n                    // Fall back to all users if no group is selected\n                    numberOfUsers = usernames!!.size - 1 // Exclude \"Select a payor:\"\n                } else {\n                    individualPayment!!.text = \"₱ 0\"\n                    return\n                }\n\n                totalIndividualPayment = amount / numberOfUsers\n                individualPayment!!.text =\n                    CurrencyUtils.formatAmountWithCurrency(\n                        totalIndividualPayment\n                    )\n            } catch (e: NumberFormatException) {\n                individualPayment!!.text = \"₱ 0\"\n            }\n        } else {\n            individualPayment!!.text = \"₱ 0\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun detailsCharacterCount() {\n        // Implement character count logic here if needed\n    }\n\n    private fun exitEditText() {\n        // Implement exit edit text logic here if needed\n    }\n\n    private fun loadExistingGroups() {\n        val groupsRef = DeclareDatabase.dBRefGroups.child(currentUserId!!)\n        groupsRef.addValueEventListener(object : ValueEventListener {\n            override fun onDataChange(dataSnapshot: DataSnapshot) {\n                groupsContainer!!.removeAllViews()\n                groupViews!!.clear()\n                payerGroups!!.clear()\n\n                for (groupSnapshot in dataSnapshot.children) {\n                    val group = groupSnapshot.getValue(PayerGroup::class.java)\n                    if (group != null) {\n                        group.groupId = groupSnapshot.key\n                        payerGroups!!.add(group)\n                        addGroupView(group)\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            override fun onCancelled(databaseError: DatabaseError) {\n                Log.e(\"FirebaseDatabase\", \"Failed to load groups: \" + databaseError.message)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n\n    private fun addGroupView(group: PayerGroup) {\n        val inflater = LayoutInflater.from(this)\n        val groupView = inflater.inflate(R.layout.item_group, groupsContainer, false)\n\n        val groupNameTV = groupView.findViewById<TextView>(R.id.groupName)\n        val groupMembersTV = groupView.findViewById<TextView>(R.id.groupMembers)\n        val editBtn = groupView.findViewById<Button>(R.id.editGroupBtn)\n        val removeBtn = groupView.findViewById<Button>(R.id.removeGroupBtn)\n\n        groupNameTV.text = group.groupName\n\n        // Use display names if available, otherwise resolve UIDs to usernames\n        val displayNames = group.memberDisplayNames\n        if (displayNames != null && !displayNames.isEmpty()) {\n            val membersText = \"Members: \" + java.lang.String.join(\", \", displayNames)\n            groupMembersTV.text = membersText\n        } else if (group.members != null) {\n            // Legacy data or need to resolve UIDs - try to get display names from cache\n            val resolvedNames: MutableList<kotlin.String?> = ArrayList<kotlin.String?>()\n            for (memberIdOrName in group.members!!) {\n                val displayName = uidToUsernameMap[memberIdOrName]\n                if (displayName != null) {\n                    resolvedNames.add(displayName)\n                } else {\n                    // Could be old format with username directly\n                    resolvedNames.add(memberIdOrName)\n                }\n            }\n            val membersText = \"Members: \" + java.lang.String.join(\", \", resolvedNames)\n            groupMembersTV.text = membersText\n        }\n\n        editBtn.setOnClickListener { v: View? ->\n            showEditGroupDialog(\n                group,\n                groupView\n            )\n        }\n        removeBtn.setOnClickListener { v: View? ->\n            showRemoveGroupConfirmation(\n                group,\n                groupView\n            )\n        }\n\n        // Add click listener for group selection\n        groupView.setOnClickListener { v: View? ->\n            selectGroup(\n                group,\n                groupView\n            )\n        }\n\n        groupViews!!.add(groupView)\n        groupsContainer!!.addView(groupView)\n    }\n\n    private fun selectGroup(group: PayerGroup, groupView: View) {\n        // If the same group is tapped again, deselect it\n        if (selectedGroup != null && selectedGroup!!.groupId == group.groupId) {\n            deselectGroup()\n            return\n        }\n\n        // Deselect previous group if any\n        if (selectedGroupView != null) {\n            selectedGroupView!!.setBackgroundResource(R.drawable.rounded_border_transparent_bg)\n        }\n\n        // Select the new group\n        selectedGroup = group\n        selectedGroupView = groupView\n        groupView.setBackgroundResource(R.drawable.rounded_border_selected_bg)\n\n        // Set group member display names for the spinner (not UIDs)\n        val memberUsernames = ArrayList<kotlin.String?>()\n        memberUsernames.add(\"Select a payor:\")\n\n        // Use display names for spinner if available, otherwise resolve from cache\n        val groupDisplayNames = group.memberDisplayNames\n        if (groupDisplayNames != null && groupDisplayNames.isNotEmpty()) {\n            memberUsernames.addAll(groupDisplayNames)\n        } else if (group.members != null) {\n            // Resolve UIDs to display names from cache\n            for (memberIdOrName in group.members!!) {\n                val displayName = uidToUsernameMap[memberIdOrName]\n                if (displayName != null) {\n                    memberUsernames.add(displayName)\n                } else {\n                    // Could be old format with username directly\n                    memberUsernames.add(memberIdOrName)\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        groupMemberUsernames = memberUsernames\n\n        // Enable btnAdd and hide tooltip when a group is selected\n        btnAdd!!.isEnabled = true\n        btnAdd!!.alpha = 1.0f\n        dismissPayorTooltip()\n\n        // Show and update the first row with group members\n        if (firstRow != null) {\n            firstRow!!.visibility = View.VISIBLE\n            updateRowSpinnerWithGroupMembers(firstRow!!)\n        }\n\n        // Update existing rows' spinners with group members\n        for (row in rows!!) {\n            updateRowSpinnerWithGroupMembers(row)\n        }\n\n        // Recalculate individual payment based on selected group members\n        calculateAndDisplayIndividualPayment()\n\n        Toast.makeText(this, \"Selected group: \" + group.groupName, Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n    }\n\n    private fun updateRowSpinnerWithGroupMembers(row: View) {\n        val spinner = row.findViewById<Spinner?>(R.id.payor)\n        val memberUsernames = groupMemberUsernames\n        if (spinner != null && memberUsernames != null && memberUsernames.isNotEmpty()) {\n            val adapter = SpinnerItem(this@AddTransactionActivity, memberUsernames)\n            adapter.setDropDownViewResource(android.R.layout.simple_spinner_dropdown_item)\n            spinner.adapter = adapter\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun deselectGroup() {\n        if (selectedGroupView != null) {\n            selectedGroupView!!.setBackgroundResource(R.drawable.rounded_border_transparent_bg)\n        }\n        selectedGroup = null\n        selectedGroupView = null\n        groupMemberUsernames = null\n\n        // Disable btnAdd and show tooltip when no group is selected\n        btnAdd!!.isEnabled = false\n        btnAdd!!.alpha = 0.5f\n        showPayorTooltip()\n\n        // Hide the first row when no group is selected\n        if (firstRow != null) {\n            firstRow!!.visibility = View.GONE\n        }\n\n        // Remove all additional rows (keep only the first hidden row)\n        while (rows!!.size > 1) {\n            val row = rows!![rows!!.size - 1]\n            container!!.removeView(row)\n            rows!!.remove(row)\n        }\n\n        calculateAndDisplayIndividualPayment()\n        Toast.makeText(this, \"Group deselected\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n    }\n\n    private fun showCreateGroupDialog() {\n        if (usernames == null || usernames!!.size <= 1) {\n            Toast.makeText(this, \"No users available to add to group\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n            return\n        }\n\n        val builder = AlertDialog.Builder(this)\n        val dialogView = LayoutInflater.from(this).inflate(R.layout.dialog_create_group, null)\n        builder.setView(dialogView)\n\n        val dialog = builder.create()\n\n        val groupNameEditText = dialogView.findViewById<EditText>(R.id.groupNameEditText)\n        val usersCheckboxContainer =\n            dialogView.findViewById<LinearLayout>(R.id.usersCheckboxContainer)\n        val cancelBtn = dialogView.findViewById<Button>(R.id.cancelGroupBtn)\n        val createBtn = dialogView.findViewById<Button>(R.id.createGroupBtn)\n\n        val checkBoxes: MutableList<CheckBox> = ArrayList<CheckBox>()\n\n        // Add checkboxes for each user (skip \"Select a payor:\" and current user)\n        for (i in 1 until usernames!!.size) {\n            val username = usernames!![i]\n            val uid = usernameToUidMap[username]\n\n            // Skip the current user in the UI\n            if (uid != null && uid == currentUserId) {\n                continue\n            }\n\n            val checkBox = CheckBox(this)\n            checkBox.text = username\n            checkBox.setTextColor(resources.getColor(R.color.darkBlue))\n            checkBox.setPadding(8, 8, 8, 8)\n            checkBoxes.add(checkBox)\n            usersCheckboxContainer.addView(checkBox)\n        }\n\n        cancelBtn.setOnClickListener { v: View? -> dialog.dismiss() }\n\n        createBtn.setOnClickListener { v: View? ->\n            val groupName = groupNameEditText.text.toString().trim()\n            if (TextUtils.isEmpty(groupName)) {\n                Toast.makeText(this, \"Please enter a group name\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                return@setOnClickListener\n            }\n\n            val selectedMemberUids: MutableList<kotlin.String?> = ArrayList<kotlin.String?>()\n            val selectedMemberDisplayNames: MutableList<kotlin.String?> =\n                ArrayList<kotlin.String?>()\n\n            // Automatically include current user\n            selectedMemberUids.add(currentUserId)\n            val currentUserDisplayName = uidToUsernameMap[currentUserId]\n            selectedMemberDisplayNames.add(if (currentUserDisplayName != null) currentUserDisplayName else \"Me\")\n\n            for (checkBox in checkBoxes) {\n                if (checkBox.isChecked) {\n                    val displayName = checkBox.text.toString()\n                    val uid = usernameToUidMap[displayName]\n                    if (uid != null) {\n                        selectedMemberUids.add(uid)\n                        selectedMemberDisplayNames.add(displayName)\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            if (selectedMemberUids.size <= 1) {\n                Toast.makeText(this, \"Please select at least one member\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                return@setOnClickListener\n            }\n\n            saveGroupToDatabase(groupName, selectedMemberUids, selectedMemberDisplayNames)\n            dialog.dismiss()\n        }\n\n        dialog.show()\n    }\n\n    private fun saveGroupToDatabase(\n        groupName: kotlin.String?,\n        memberUids: MutableList<kotlin.String?>?,\n        memberDisplayNames: MutableList<kotlin.String?>?\n    ) {\n        val groupsRef = DeclareDatabase.dBRefGroups.child(currentUserId!!)\n        val groupId = groupsRef.push().key\n\n        if (groupId != null) {\n            // Store member UIDs and display names\n            val newGroup =\n                PayerGroup(groupId, groupName, memberUids, currentUserId, memberDisplayNames)\n            groupsRef.child(groupId).setValue(newGroup)\n                .addOnSuccessListener { aVoid: Void? ->\n                    Toast.makeText(this, \"Group created successfully\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                    // Reload groups to show the new group\n                    loadExistingGroups()\n                }\n                .addOnFailureListener { e: Exception? ->\n                    Toast.makeText(this, \"Failed to create group\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                    Log.e(\"FirebaseDatabase\", \"Failed to save group: \" + e!!.message)\n                }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun showEditGroupDialog(group: PayerGroup, groupView: View) {\n        if (usernames == null || usernames!!.size <= 1) {\n            Toast.makeText(this, \"No users available to edit group\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n            return\n        }\n\n        val builder = AlertDialog.Builder(this)\n        val dialogView = LayoutInflater.from(this).inflate(R.layout.dialog_edit_group, null)\n        builder.setView(dialogView)\n\n        val dialog = builder.create()\n\n        val groupNameEditText = dialogView.findViewById<EditText>(R.id.editGroupNameEditText)\n        val usersCheckboxContainer =\n            dialogView.findViewById<LinearLayout>(R.id.editUsersCheckboxContainer)\n        val cancelBtn = dialogView.findViewById<Button>(R.id.cancelEditGroupBtn)\n        val saveBtn = dialogView.findViewById<Button>(R.id.saveEditGroupBtn)\n\n        // Pre-fill the group name\n        groupNameEditText.setText(group.groupName)\n\n        val checkBoxes: MutableList<CheckBox> = ArrayList<CheckBox>()\n\n        // Add checkboxes for each user (skip \"Select a payor:\" and current user)\n        for (i in 1 until usernames!!.size) {\n            val username = usernames!![i]\n            val uid = usernameToUidMap[username]\n\n            // Skip the current user in the UI\n            if (uid != null && uid == currentUserId) {\n                continue\n            }\n\n            val checkBox = CheckBox(this)\n            checkBox.text = username\n            checkBox.setTextColor(resources.getColor(R.color.darkBlue))\n            checkBox.setPadding(8, 8, 8, 8)\n\n            // Check if this user is already in the group (by UID or by display name for legacy data)\n            var isInGroup = false\n            if (uid != null && group.members != null && group.members!!.contains(uid)) {\n                isInGroup = true\n            } else if (group.memberDisplayNames != null && group.memberDisplayNames!!\n                    .contains(username)\n            ) {\n                isInGroup = true\n            } else if (group.members != null && group.members!!.contains(username)) {\n                // Legacy: check if username is directly in members (old data format)\n                isInGroup = true\n            }\n            checkBox.isChecked = isInGroup\n\n            checkBoxes.add(checkBox)\n            usersCheckboxContainer.addView(checkBox)\n        }\n\n        cancelBtn.setOnClickListener { v: View? -> dialog.dismiss() }\n\n        saveBtn.setOnClickListener { v: View? ->\n            val groupName = groupNameEditText.text.toString().trim()\n            if (TextUtils.isEmpty(groupName)) {\n                Toast.makeText(this, \"Please enter a group name\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                return@setOnClickListener\n            }\n\n            val selectedMemberUids: MutableList<kotlin.String?> = ArrayList<kotlin.String?>()\n            val selectedMemberDisplayNames: MutableList<kotlin.String?> =\n                ArrayList<kotlin.String?>()\n\n            // Automatically include current user\n            selectedMemberUids.add(currentUserId)\n            val currentUserDisplayName = uidToUsernameMap[currentUserId]\n            selectedMemberDisplayNames.add(if (currentUserDisplayName != null) currentUserDisplayName else \"Me\")\n\n            for (checkBox in checkBoxes) {\n                if (checkBox.isChecked) {\n                    val displayName = checkBox.text.toString()\n                    val uid = usernameToUidMap[displayName]\n                    if (uid != null) {\n                        selectedMemberUids.add(uid)\n                        selectedMemberDisplayNames.add(displayName)\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            if (selectedMemberUids.size <= 1) {\n                Toast.makeText(this, \"Please select at least one member\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                return@setOnClickListener\n            }\n\n            val groupId = group.groupId\n            if (groupId != null) {\n                updateGroupInDatabase(\n                    groupId,\n                    groupName,\n                    selectedMemberUids,\n                    selectedMemberDisplayNames,\n                    groupView\n                )\n            }\n            dialog.dismiss()\n        }\n\n        dialog.show()\n    }\n\n    private fun updateGroupInDatabase(\n        groupId: kotlin.String,\n        groupName: kotlin.String?,\n        memberUids: MutableList<kotlin.String?>?,\n        memberDisplayNames: MutableList<kotlin.String?>,\n        groupView: View\n    ) {\n        val groupRef = DeclareDatabase.dBRefGroups\n            .child(currentUserId!!)\n            .child(groupId)\n\n        val updatedGroup =\n            PayerGroup(groupId, groupName, memberUids, currentUserId, memberDisplayNames)\n        groupRef.setValue(updatedGroup)\n            .addOnSuccessListener { aVoid: Void? ->\n                Toast.makeText(this, \"Group updated successfully\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                // Update the group view immediately\n                val groupNameTV = groupView.findViewById<TextView>(R.id.groupName)\n                val groupMembersTV = groupView.findViewById<TextView>(R.id.groupMembers)\n                groupNameTV.text = groupName\n                val membersText = \"Members: \" + java.lang.String.join(\", \", memberDisplayNames)\n                groupMembersTV.text = membersText\n\n                // If this group is currently selected, update the selected group object\n                val currentSelectedGroup = selectedGroup\n                if (currentSelectedGroup != null && currentSelectedGroup.groupId == groupId) {\n                    currentSelectedGroup.groupName = groupName\n                    currentSelectedGroup.members = memberUids\n                    currentSelectedGroup.memberDisplayNames = memberDisplayNames\n                    calculateAndDisplayIndividualPayment()\n                }\n            }\n            .addOnFailureListener { e: Exception? ->\n                Toast.makeText(this, \"Failed to update group\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                Log.e(\"FirebaseDatabase\", \"Failed to update group: \" + e!!.message)\n            }\n    }\n\n    private fun showRemoveGroupConfirmation(group: PayerGroup, groupView: View?) {\n        val builder = AlertDialog.Builder(this)\n        val dialogView = LayoutInflater.from(this).inflate(R.layout.dialog_remove_group, null)\n        builder.setView(dialogView)\n\n        val dialog = builder.create()\n\n        val groupNameTV = dialogView.findViewById<TextView>(R.id.groupNameToRemove)\n        val cancelBtn = dialogView.findViewById<Button>(R.id.cancelRemoveBtn)\n        val confirmBtn = dialogView.findViewById<Button>(R.id.confirmRemoveBtn)\n\n        groupNameTV.text = group.groupName\n\n        cancelBtn.setOnClickListener { v: View? -> dialog.dismiss() }\n\n        confirmBtn.setOnClickListener { v: View? ->\n            removeGroupFromDatabase(group, groupView)\n            dialog.dismiss()\n        }\n\n        dialog.show()\n    }\n\n    private fun removeGroupFromDatabase(group: PayerGroup, groupView: View?) {\n        val groupId = group.groupId\n        if (groupId == null) return\n\n        val groupRef = DeclareDatabase.dBRefGroups\n            .child(currentUserId!!)\n            .child(groupId)\n\n        groupRef.removeValue()\n            .addOnSuccessListener { aVoid: Void? ->\n                Toast.makeText(this, \"Group removed successfully\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                groupsContainer!!.removeView(groupView)\n                groupViews!!.remove(groupView)\n                payerGroups!!.remove(group)\n            }\n            .addOnFailureListener { e: Exception? ->\n                Toast.makeText(this, \"Failed to remove group\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                Log.e(\"FirebaseDatabase\", \"Failed to remove group: \" + e!!.message)\n            }\n    }\n\n    private fun showPayorTooltip() {\n        if (btnAdd == null) return\n\n        // Dismiss existing tooltip if any\n        dismissPayorTooltip()\n\n        // Inflate tooltip view from XML\n        val tooltipView = LayoutInflater.from(this).inflate(R.layout.tooltip_add_payor, null)\n\n        // Create PopupWindow - non-focusable so keyboard stays in front\n        payorTooltipPopup = PopupWindow(\n            tooltipView,\n            ViewGroup.LayoutParams.WRAP_CONTENT,\n            ViewGroup.LayoutParams.WRAP_CONTENT,\n            false // Not focusable - allows keyboard to stay on top\n        )\n        payorTooltipPopup!!.setBackgroundDrawable(ColorDrawable(Color.TRANSPARENT))\n        payorTooltipPopup!!.isOutsideTouchable = false\n        payorTooltipPopup!!.setTouchable(false) // Don't intercept touch events\n        payorTooltipPopup!!.inputMethodMode = PopupWindow.INPUT_METHOD_NEEDED // Allow input method to appear on top\n\n\n        // Set low elevation so keyboard appears above tooltip\n        if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.LOLLIPOP) {\n            payorTooltipPopup!!.elevation = 0f\n        }\n\n        // Measure tooltip to get its dimensions\n        tooltipView.measure(View.MeasureSpec.UNSPECIFIED, View.MeasureSpec.UNSPECIFIED)\n        val tooltipHeight = tooltipView.measuredHeight\n        val tooltipWidth = tooltipView.measuredWidth\n\n        // Post to ensure the button is laid out before showing tooltip\n        btnAdd!!.post {\n            if (payorTooltipPopup != null && btnAdd!!.isAttachedToWindow) {\n                // Position tooltip at upper left corner of the button\n                // offsetX = negative tooltip width to position left of the button's left edge\n                // offsetY = negative (button height + tooltip height) to position above the button\n                val offsetX = -tooltipWidth\n                val offsetY = -(btnAdd!!.height + tooltipHeight)\n                payorTooltipPopup!!.showAsDropDown(btnAdd, offsetX, offsetY, Gravity.START)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun dismissPayorTooltip() {\n        if (payorTooltipPopup != null && payorTooltipPopup!!.isShowing) {\n            payorTooltipPopup!!.dismiss()\n            payorTooltipPopup = null\n        }\n    }\n\n    override fun onDestroy() {\n        super.onDestroy()\n        dismissPayorTooltip()\n    }\n\n    override fun dispatchTouchEvent(event: MotionEvent): Boolean {\n        if (event.action == MotionEvent.ACTION_DOWN) {\n            val v = currentFocus\n            if (v is EditText) {\n                val location = IntArray(2)\n                v.getLocationOnScreen(location)\n                val x = event.rawX\n                val y = event.getRawY()\n\n                // Check if touch is outside the focused EditText\n                if (x < location[0] || x > location[0] + v.width || y < location[1] || y > location[1] + v.height) {\n                    hideKeyboard(v)\n                    v.clearFocus()\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return super.dispatchTouchEvent(event)\n    }\n\n    private fun hideKeyboard(view: View) {\n        val imm = getSystemService(INPUT_METHOD_SERVICE) as InputMethodManager?\n        if (imm != null) {\n            imm.hideSoftInputFromWindow(view.windowToken, 0)\n        }\n    }\n}\n
